{"3368550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Panzer Planet", "steam_appid": 3368550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/76c0164b67a94e7d52cf29ac72b23d9d.avif?t=1769059814\" width=800 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Panzer Planet, you're not just fighting for survival—you're reclaiming worlds! Blast through waves of relentless enemies, gather coins, and build the ultimate tank with game-breaking upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/14bf47c2d3e187a475be724f485d68d3.poster.avif?t=1769059814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/14bf47c2d3e187a475be724f485d68d3.webm?t=1769059814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/14bf47c2d3e187a475be724f485d68d3.mp4?t=1769059814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a fearless bounty hunter, hired by desperate planets across the cosmos to eradicate their monstrous invaders. Your tool of choice? A devastatingly overpowered battle tank equipped with flamethrowers, guided missiles, energy shields, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🛡️ Customize, Upgrade, Dominate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically pick your upgrades between waves, stack your build, and unlock game-breaking synergies that will turn your tank into a planet-destroying force. Flamethrowers for clearing crowds? Shield upgrades to withstand the onslaught? Homing missiles to snipe enemies across the planet? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/22ceb8380b931588b61034e4fd9042e1.poster.avif?t=1769059814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/22ceb8380b931588b61034e4fd9042e1.webm?t=1769059814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/22ceb8380b931588b61034e4fd9042e1.mp4?t=1769059814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn them with a flamethrower!, exterminate them with guided missiles and cannon projectiles!, protect from enemy bullets with your energy shield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/0dcc5f0c89f012869041ce35f2ac4517.poster.avif?t=1769059814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/0dcc5f0c89f012869041ce35f2ac4517.webm?t=1769059814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/0dcc5f0c89f012869041ce35f2ac4517.mp4?t=1769059814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete runs and unlock new vehicles with special and unique abilities </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/eb184c5edc97ab27eb30121e41061ab7.poster.avif?t=1769059814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/eb184c5edc97ab27eb30121e41061ab7.webm?t=1769059814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/eb184c5edc97ab27eb30121e41061ab7.mp4?t=1769059814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎯 Key Features of Panzer Planet:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮 Twin-Stick Shooter Excellence: Precise controls, tight shooting mechanics, and chaotic action from start to finish.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🪐 Spherical Mini-Planet Arenas: Battle on fully-rounded planets where strategy and positioning matter just as much as your firepower.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💥 Bullet Hell Action: Dodge, weave, and retaliate as waves of enemies close in with relentless ferocity.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🛠️ Massive Arsenal: Dozens of unique weapons and power-ups to unlock and combine for devastating effects. From flamethrowers to guided missiles, it's your playground of destruction.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🪙 Shop Between Waves: Collect coins, visit the shop, and upgrade your tank between rounds for even more carnage.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🚩 Multiple Difficulty Modes: Whether you’re a casual player or a hardcore bullet-hell veteran, there’s a challenge waiting for you.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔄 Fast-Paced Runs: Quick, action-packed runs under 30 minutes keep the gameplay loop fresh and addictive.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🚀 Unlockable Vehicles: Each with unique abilities that add depth, strategy, and replayability to every battle.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚙️ Procedurally Generated Chaos: Every run is different thanks to randomized waves, upgrades, and loot drops.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ <strong>Perfect For Fans Of:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin Stick Shooters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet Hell Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Arena Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally Generated Roguelites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicular Combat</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/76c0164b67a94e7d52cf29ac72b23d9d.avif?t=1769059814\" width=800 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Panzer Planet, you're not just fighting for survival—you're reclaiming worlds! Blast through waves of relentless enemies, gather coins, and build the ultimate tank with game-breaking upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/14bf47c2d3e187a475be724f485d68d3.poster.avif?t=1769059814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/14bf47c2d3e187a475be724f485d68d3.webm?t=1769059814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/14bf47c2d3e187a475be724f485d68d3.mp4?t=1769059814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a fearless bounty hunter, hired by desperate planets across the cosmos to eradicate their monstrous invaders. Your tool of choice? A devastatingly overpowered battle tank equipped with flamethrowers, guided missiles, energy shields, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🛡️ Customize, Upgrade, Dominate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically pick your upgrades between waves, stack your build, and unlock game-breaking synergies that will turn your tank into a planet-destroying force. Flamethrowers for clearing crowds? Shield upgrades to withstand the onslaught? Homing missiles to snipe enemies across the planet? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/22ceb8380b931588b61034e4fd9042e1.poster.avif?t=1769059814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/22ceb8380b931588b61034e4fd9042e1.webm?t=1769059814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/22ceb8380b931588b61034e4fd9042e1.mp4?t=1769059814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn them with a flamethrower!, exterminate them with guided missiles and cannon projectiles!, protect from enemy bullets with your energy shield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/0dcc5f0c89f012869041ce35f2ac4517.poster.avif?t=1769059814\" w